E AX3142 1499-field-effect-named.ax:28:16-21 field-effect-exceeded "`shout` performs Alloc, IO, and the field `Check.test` declares `effect(pure)`" #"performs Alloc, IO" !"a call through `Check.test` is charged what the field declares and nothing else, so everything stored in it has to keep that" ?"store a function that keeps the declaration, or declare the effect on the field with `;@axiom:effect(io)`"
